+| `mask_terminal_patch_valid` | 1 | — | — | 1 iff the last observation had ≥ 3 returns and a normal | exit | — |
+| `mask_terminal_contacting` | 1 | — | — | equals `obs_terminal_contacting` | exit | — |
+
